        followUps: "<p>How would you use Playwright's own versioning to isolate whether it's the browser build or something else? What would a non-blocking \"canary\" job for new browser versions look like in CI? How do you decide whether to fix the app, add a compatibility shim in the test helper, or wait for an upstream fix?</p>",
